# Diary / letter pager

When working in these files (or on clipping, caret, Enter/Backspace at page edges, welded lines, spill/absorb):

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/diary-letter-pager/SKILL.md` (and `reference.md` when linked).
2. **Never** move text between pages outside the pager, re-join blocks that are not continuations (`cont`), or build a print layout besides the live clone.
3. Edits stay inside one cell; never write attributes or styles onto DOM that ProseMirror manages.
4. Gate with `npm test` and the e2e step in the skill (`make test-e2e`, or its two-spec fallback command).
